TECHNICAL ARCHITECTURE
Paste this:
The Product Inventory Management System follows a three-layer architecture consisting of the Presentation Layer, Application Layer, and Database Layer. The Presentation Layer provides the user interface for managing products and inventory. The Application Layer handles business logic such as adding, updating, deleting, searching, and checking product stock. The Database Layer stores product information including Product ID, Product Name, Category, Quantity, Price, and Supplier details. The system can be developed using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Python Flask, and SQLite/MySQL.
